window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>An Innocent Princess, a Brother bound on Revenge, an Unexpected Twist that Changes Everything...</b><br> <br> Taking revenge on his enemies for his brothers' sake, Killian Darkpaw steals the daughter of a rival leader. Persuading her she's been arranged to marry him, he tricks her into a relationship.<br> <br> As his deceit is uncovered....<br> <br> War horns sound.<br> <br> However, Killian isn't all that he seems.</p> <p>*Taken by the Wolf King is a clean fantasy romance and is appropriate for teens/young adults. This is book one in a series. It ends on a cliffhanger and the series must be listened to in order.</p>"; 
